<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ debt market closed for bank holiday.</title>
<headline>NZ debt market closed for bank holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand debt markets were closed on Thursday for the Waitangi Day national holiday.</p>
<p>The following is a snapshot of rates at Wednesday's close.</p>
<p>Figures in brackets compare against previous day's close</p>
<p>FUTURES					  PHYSICAL YIELD (PCT)</p>
<p>90-DAY BILLS (MAR) 92.73 (PREV 92.69)  90-DAYS  7.38 (PREV 7.40) 3-YR BONDS   (MAR) 92.90 (PREV 92.87)  02/00    7.08 (PREV 7.09)</p>
<p>10-YR BONDS  (MAR) 92.75 (PREV 92.75)  11/06    7.22 (PREV 7.22)</p>
<p>OVERNIGHT CASH   7.40 PCT (PREV 7.40)</p>
